{"name":"main","commit":{"sha":"66d9c79f6472ddace0e265335dc8dd36cdeb8a86","node_id":"C_kwDOULC0qdoAKDY2ZDljNzlmNjQ3MmRkYWNlMGUyNjUzMzVkYzhkZDM2Y2RlYjhhODY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Alexey Zhokhov","email":"alexey@zhokhov.com","date":"2026-09-08T13:43:02Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-09-08T13:43:02Z"},"message":"chore: dissolve shared/references into owning skills (#1)\n\nDelete the wholesale-copied shared/references staging set (6 byte-identical\nfiles propagated into every repo at monorepo split, 73% never cited) and keep\nthe byte-identical skill-local copies as the canonical home:\n\n- runtime-trust.md: existing vendored copies in every skill become canonical\n- contribution-handoff.md: the five tailrocks-contribute-* skills\n- repository-audit-lanes.md: tailrocks-improve and tailrocks-improve-deep\n- version-policy.md: the 13 renamed shared-version-policy.md skill copies\n- design-pipeline.md: the five design skills, which now cite it\n- pr-conventions.md: removed everywhere; the policy is owned by\n  tailrocks-create-pr/references/repo-conventions.md (verified superset)\n\nAlso wire previously implicit citations (design-pipeline in the web, tui and\nmacos design skills plus macos-visual-baseline; version-policy in the tanstack\naudit/remediate/migrate skills with the corrected baseline-reference count),\nadd the waiver-policy paragraph to tailrocks-document, change \"generated\" to\n\"vendored\" in the two surviving repository-audit-lanes copies, and regenerate\ngenerated docs where skill-local files were removed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ffa202cb4dd97be154ce00a47f10cf7ca4ebf196","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-roadmap-skills/git/trees/ffa202cb4dd97be154ce00a47f10cf7ca4ebf196"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-roadmap-skills/git/commits/66d9c79f6472ddace0e265335dc8dd36cdeb8a86","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoBDmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjKkQAJP6t75/SalTpgvn4vfEyRoW\neOBxfOYOMPh+WJuWPbyDpqrOzFfuGIPFhXA6JD4D4V9SNonz5x6VXNlxZ7alcFIa\nkyFXyeIOmTnEpuWbt/L6foP5tfdz7YwybLR4g4hWXkz3Y9Os2lPFEDHAGuZi4GMk\nE2gHjVYS58I4NGi5JRxkJfH8L01O/rZZRMj3I5S27mHFT7iclC1kmF7JAI4rr6tj\nATgebpIoRRr3lL8+CRkXDO5mLb7BreCjr1z7Xk3cNUqcSdA/DSO4lKzQU3tHQx3N\nzQVG99H5PuUNxbHk4jzN0uWKK9y0Ab4ic2Zq5L8+7l4sRZDZQan6+4EhpHF0DIbx\npEoo05alAyorog7AqqKM23R9fwk37ca3O08U2sB8jA8nBTuln3QrJZ5Hg8Ie2SS9\nXBhvZYiU+4jkAceKNYXZoR/hxFESfwyqHvVJeA9rJ8Xwj1ZC2yoYaZdEiMcfJcP4\nxppN3haKb10nPyu36lgy2S/fdVb2rjR8fuvgcC0yKavv2V/60bgyVhN+K22f3xL9\nnmX0hVJM1P15nKttGVZ/fbW1fL+Az4WlFA78dSRwj+EwxhIp+37dDloOAOigP4LP\nZY+HBBck5piRaRlyd0rALxTChM61kIial8rToNe04uIVBdmkfHmtxgYejzQvIaPe\nvQL/IHJWYM2m7IyJt1bG\n=Auys\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree ffa202cb4dd97be154ce00a47f10cf7ca4ebf196\nparent 858dc3f37a81414a25842b33c2f90ca36d6a1e46\nauthor Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com> 1788874982 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788874982 +0700\n\nchore: dissolve shared/references into owning skills (#1)\n\nDelete the wholesale-copied shared/references staging set (6 byte-identical\nfiles propagated into every repo at monorepo split, 73% never cited) and keep\nthe byte-identical skill-local copies as the canonical home:\n\n- runtime-trust.md: existing vendored copies in every skill become canonical\n- contribution-handoff.md: the five tailrocks-contribute-* skills\n- repository-audit-lanes.md: tailrocks-improve and tailrocks-improve-deep\n- version-policy.md: the 13 renamed shared-version-policy.md skill copies\n- design-pipeline.md: the five design skills, which now cite it\n- pr-conventions.md: removed everywhere; the policy is owned by\n  tailrocks-create-pr/references/repo-conventions.md (verified superset)\n\nAlso wire previously implicit citations (design-pipeline in the web, tui and\nmacos design skills plus macos-visual-baseline; version-policy in the tanstack\naudit/remediate/migrate skills with the corrected baseline-reference count),\nadd the waiver-policy paragraph to tailrocks-document, change \"generated\" to\n\"vendored\" in the two surviving repository-audit-lanes copies, and regenerate\ngenerated docs where skill-local files were removed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2026-09-08T13:43:03Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-roadmap-skills/commits/66d9c79f6472ddace0e265335dc8dd36cdeb8a86","html_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/tailrocks-roadmap-skills/commit/66d9c79f6472ddace0e265335dc8dd36cdeb8a86","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-roadmap-skills/commits/66d9c79f6472ddace0e265335dc8dd36cdeb8a86/comments","author":{"login":"donbeave","id":139017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTAxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave","html_url":"https://github.com/donbeave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https